        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.8.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 8.42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Every one who believes that Jesus is the Christ is a child of God, and every one who loves the parent loves the child. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By this we know that we love the children of God, when we love God and obey his commandments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 14.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2JN.1.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Jn 6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For this is the love of God, that we keep his commandments. And his commandments are not burdensome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.16.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 16.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For whatever is born of God overcomes the world; and this is the victory that overcomes the world, our faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who is it that overcomes the world but he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
